**But:** One parent reports a specific change helping: "We ran out of coffee and the freaking plague hit us so no one left to replenish. All of sudden, I was falling asleep fast at night even though I was so stuffed up I couldn't breathe. Decided to keep at it after illness- same result." [sr040-0096]

