Only the first excerpt explicitly reports a purchase: a home, rather than a purchase made to solve the child-related question. The remaining excerpts name food, clothing, equipment or tools in use; payment is not stated, so those posts have bought=no. There are no five distinct yes-post purchase accounts to quote.

