**But:** One parent reports longer sleep after a hurricane disrupted the usual routine; this share does not support every change making sleep worse: "But the good thing is she started sleeping longer stretches again. Like much longer than even before those 2 regression nights. She went to 3-5 wake ups a night, then 6-8 during the regression nights. Now only one wake up." [sr128-0034]

