Tags use explicit statements by the speaker: tried includes completed preparations and consultations; others covers other adults' actions, advice or accounts, rather than the child's own behaviour or a shared attempt described only as “we”. Bought requires an explicit purchase or order; possession or use alone does not qualify. Feeling includes named curiosity, enjoyment and sensory aversion as well as distress. These counts describe posts in this share of pattern 0 from the supplied random sample of 20,000 posts, not people or the wider market. All 31 yes posts and all 213 near posts were read and individually tagged; nothing in the share remains unread.

### What they tried, in their words

