**But:** The six-month-old daycare baby's parent asks whether short naps are a problem at all when the child is happy and healthy: "Can I just ignore these issues with naps? Are they even issues if she's happy, healthy and not miserable? My husband says I am making an issue out of nothing and we should go based on her mood and health versus assuming every baby has the same sleep needs." [sr051-0050]

