### The parent wants the first meeting between a toddler and a newborn to go well.

1 of 31 posts.

The parent is leaving hospital with a newborn and has a 22-month-old at home. A neutral-area introduction is planned, but the parent describes being anxious while trying to stay strong for the wife and asks for insight or encouragement.

- "We have a 22 month old at home and I’m just so worried about the introduction and how things are going to go." [sr041-0001]
- "Staying strong and being the rock for my wife but I’m just anxious inside." [sr041-0001]
- "Have a plan for introduction in a neutral area and all the basic stuff. But any insight or words of encouragement are very appreciated!" [sr041-0001]

