### The parent fears a sleep regression will undo sleep that is going well.

6 of 213 posts.

Parents of an eight-week-old, three- to three-and-a-half-month-olds and 14-week-old twins ask how severe the anticipated four-month regression will be. One has just emerged from a difficult spell at 11 weeks and fears it happening again. Their questions concern whether setbacks are inevitable, whether feeds return and whether sleep recovers naturally or needs training.

