- "We go to parks (I’ll baby wear her facing forward) and I wave at everyone (that looks friendly enough to wave back) to try and teach her this social gesture." [sr115-0127]
- "I called his doc and they told me to watch out for signs of head injuries, which made me worry even more." [sr059-0013]
- "I was slowly weaning my at the time 10month old off her pacifier, we were down to using it only to sleep." [sr063-0038]
- "she's already teetering on low iron (which I'm supplementing but I want her to get some nutritious meals in too)." [sr094-0063]
- "We're monitoring her weight ourselves at home with a baby scale. She's 5.5m." [sr033-0125]
- "Our 7.5 week old suddenly started rolling on his side so we realised we needed to stop swaddling and move onto sleep bags" [sr123-0045]

### What other people told them or did

