### What they bought or paid for

Only one yes post explicitly reports buying or ordering anything: two protective items in the same passage. The two excerpts below cover both items; the share does not supply five purchase quotes. Using or owning equipment is not treated as an explicit purchase.

- "I just ordered really thick and soft baby mats to put on my carpet," [sr068-0059]
- "I also ordered one of those backpack things that have  a pillow under his head if he falls." [sr068-0059]

### How they say they feel

