**Reviewed by the owner:** not yet

## Limits

A random, keyword-free sample of 20,000 Reddit posts from twelve parenting subreddits, 1 April–24 October 2026, yielded 2,471 on-niche posts; this pattern holds 93 on-niche and 638 near posts, all read. Each count is posts tagged by one reader, not people or market prevalence; forms from different digest readers were merged by judgement, whole, including mixed forms. Cross tags overlap and retain readers’ definitions; unreported actions and purchases remain unknown.

